//
// PROBE: bund.exit by its own name (Bund/src/stdlib/functions/bund/bund_exit.rs:10-31).
// bund-exit.bund runs it through its alias `exit`. With a code of 0 the
// program ends there and the capture's epilogue never runs (D52).
//
"before bund.exit" println
0 bund.exit
"after bund.exit" println
